# Eternal V4 — Task Router

STANDARD_VERSION: ETERNAL_V4_UIUX_1.0
SOURCE_PLUGIN: eternal-cursor-workflow v0.1.24
REPOSITORY: eternalsabloncup-star/eternal-produksi-v4

This router only chooses when the standard applies.
It does not replace the master rule or the five skills.

Before implementation or review, read the master rule
and these five skills when the task includes any of:

- UI/UX, layout, or visual work.
- Frontend implementation.
- Responsive or CSS change.
- Component, form, table, or modal change.
- Frontend state or API behavior that the user sees.
- A backend change that materially affects UI state,
  actions, permissions, or displayed information.

.cursor/rules/eternal-v4-uiux.mdc
.cursor/skills/eternal-v4-design-system/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/eternal-v4-layout-system/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/eternal-v4-frontend-engineering/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/eternal-v4-visual-qa/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/eternal-v4-uiux-quality-gate/SKILL.md

Backend-only work that does not change the API contract
or UI behavior does not require the five skills or full
browser visual QA.

Business rules, security, RBAC, data safety, and the
engineering release gates still apply.

If a material conflict remains, HOLD and report it.
